# If an EXIF date field is missing, mark (preference)

Standing user preference: If an EXIF date field is missing, mark it as 'ABSENT'; never estimate or infer missing date values.

## Conventions
- If an EXIF date field is missing, mark it as 'ABSENT'; never estimate or infer missing date values.

